p621:record_00fd89df a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_27c786bc,
        p621:source_2e203b44,
        p621:source_410df42d ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0116 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_1468e444 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for posting pictures and texts. The Department of the Ministry of Internal Affairs in Sevastopol (MVD) stated that this individual “in his free time, was not only interested in non-traditional sexual relationships, but also actively promoted them on social media.” MVD also shared the screenshots of the individual's VK page, which the court found to be “propaganda”. On these screenshots, there are four posts made in 2020; there are such texts as “Gay guys are cool, love you”,  “I'm happy that I'm gay, the USA are super, it's the homeland of LGBT”, “Yes to gays and LGBT all over the world”, and “Here is the guy of my dreams [...]” accompanied with a reposted picture."@en,
        "Пользователь ВКонтакте был оштрафован за публикацию фотографий и текстовых постов. Управление МВД в Севастополе заявило, что этот человек “в свободное от работы время не только интересовался нетрадиционными сексуальными отношениями, но и активно пропагандировал их в социальных сетях.” МВД также опубликовало скриншоты ВК страницы, которые суд признал “пропагандой”. На этих скриншотах видно четыре поста, опубликованных в 2020; на них есть такие тексты, как “Парни геи это класс люблю вас”, “Я щастлив что я гей США вы супер это родина ЛГБТ”, “Да геям и ЛГБТ во всем мире”, “Вот парень мечты [...]” с репостом изображения."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_121,
        p621:social_media_3d8a0f3d,
        p621:social_media_4a66bad0,
        p621:social_media_93f780d0 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_7addf650,
        p621:mentioned_in_9b589cd3 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-0693/17/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:92 ;
    schema:identifier "record_00fd89df" .

p621:record_011b7adc a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_1c56e708,
        p621:source_ee8142c2 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:5177746079836 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_4b7bb7af ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The TV channel “Vostok TV” was fined for “distributing among minors information about non-traditional sexual relations”, as the mass media reported. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown; the court did not publish the decision text."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:unclear_004 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_1c47a7e4 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-1450/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_011b7adc" .

p621:record_02380185 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_d08a67df,
        p621:source_ddc68c3d ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1167847381130 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_2fe7a0da ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The online streaming platform “Okko” was fined for the film “Yves Saint Laurent” (Jalil Lespert, 2014). According to the Head of the St. Petersburg courts press office, there were multiple scenes identified in the film containing “propaganda of LGBT”, including these scenes: “two people of the same sex passionately kissing; '–What a cutie he is! –Forget it! He's into guys; -Where are the bedrooms?, -There's only one, -So you're together?, -Yes”; “two people of the same biological sex kissing, accompanied by a voice-over commentary 'I believed in the cult of fidelity, but with you everything happened incredibly quickly'.” The deputy general director of this streaming service was also fined for the same film (case 5-837/2024-162)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:245775 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_e7a6112b ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-849/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:78 ;
    schema:identifier "record_02380185" .

p621:record_02c3c938 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_6b46049e ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0008 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_d8edc106 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The product manager of the streaming service “More.tv” was fined for the TV series “The Shannara Chronicles” (Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, 2016) with the age restriction label “16+”. According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, the series “contains information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors. The court did not specify which scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:64122 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1189/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_02c3c938" .

p621:record_0479dc42 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_2f73fe1e,
        p621:source_76025011 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1237700761539 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_e2761194 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "“MangaLib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was fined for publications on its website. The publication in this case is “The Color of Sin: An Innocent Sin 2” (Oh Gye, 2024). According to the court, this manga “tells the story of a young man named Noah, who finds a place where no one knows him to live a normal life with his girlfriend, Nayeon, and two male friends in an open relationship. This material contains non-episodic depictions of non-traditional sexual relationships between characters, represented by several illustrations of supporting male characters (Noah's friends) in romantic and sexual contexts: touching, hugging, sexual interaction, etc.” The court stated that “the information displayed can be classified as revealing signs of a socio-cultural threat to the national security of the Russian Federation in terms of the protection of traditional values, since it reveals signs of ideological and psychological influence on the recipient in the form of the imposition of a destructive ideology (propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations).” This is one of at least 12 cases in a serial persecution of “MangaLib”. The manager of “MangaLib” was also prosecuted at least 12 times for different publications."@en,
        "“Мангалиб”, платформа онлайн-комиксов и манги, оштрафована за публикации на сайте. Публикация в этом деле – “Цвет греха: Непорочный грех 2” (Oh Gye). Согласно суду “в данном материале, представленным 1 томом (5 глав), повествуется о юноше по имени Ноа, который находит место, где его никто не знает, чтобы жить нормальной жизнью вместе с Наён – своей девушкой, а также двумя друзьями мужского пола, состоящими в открытых отношениях. Материал содержит неэпизодическое изображение нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений между персонажами, представленное несколькими иллюстрациями второстепенных героев мужского пола (друзья Ноа) в романтическом и сексуальном контексте: прикосновения, объятия, сексуальное взаимодействие и т.д.” Суд также заявил, что информация в этой публикации “может быть квалифицирована как обнаруживающая признаки социокультурной угрозы национальной безопасности РФ в части, касающейся защиты традиционных ценностей, так как обнаруживает признаки идеологического и психологического воздействия на реципиента в виде насаждения деструктивной идеологии (пропаганды нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений).” Это одно из как минимум 12 дел против “Мангалиб”. Менеджер платформы также был оштрафован за различные публикации не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_012 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_08881344,
        p621:mentioned_in_27517825,
        p621:mentioned_in_3abdf6e4,
        p621:mentioned_in_93fb0552 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0648/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_0479dc42" .

p621:record_04e454ff a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_c58a39e8 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0054 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_dc028e8e ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined after police identified a publicly accessible photograph on his page and classified it as “LGBT propaganda.” The ruling contains no description of the image itself: neither subject matter, text, symbols, nor persons depicted are recorded in the judgment. The finding of liability rests entirely on the police classification of the linked photograph as material related to “non-traditional sexual relations”. The exact image is unavailable."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_107 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_4b8d4638 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-839/25" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_04e454ff" .

p621:record_0549f459 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_88e46238 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1185476089919 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_00b0f093 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The company “Elton John”, which owns the queer bar “Elton bar” in Novosibirsk, was fined for five posts on Telegram and one video on YouTube. The judicial expert who analysed the content concluded that the video “contains signs of propaganda of the LGBT movement”, because in the video, it was said that “participating in a gay community and visiting gay clubs is a way to achieve social success and psychological comfort.” The defence argued that the company neither produced nor published the video; it was made by a YouTube blogger. However, the court dismissed this argument, stating that the company's director participated in the video. In the Telegram posts, the expert found “images of a six-stripe rainbow”, which constituted “signs of LGBT propaganda”. The defence denied that the Telegram posts were published by the company, but the judge stated that “there was no doubt” that the posts were made “on behalf of and in the interests” of the company."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:queer_venue_004 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_1dbf9d3b ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-65/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:54 ;
    schema:identifier "record_0549f459" .

p621:record_06124aba a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_ba4d863a ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1237700009700 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_dc93d24e ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The streaming service “Wink” was fined for distributing the movie “Danny's Game” (2016, Bill Cooper) and the TV series “The Shannara Chronicles” (2016). The court held that both titles, available with age ratings of 12+ and 16+, contained material “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations” and therefore had been unlawfully made accessible to minors. The exact scenes that constituted the violation are unclear."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:64122,
        p621:711577 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "7-13946/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_06124aba" .

