p621:record_0dfd46d0 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_97b9b543 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0028 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_e86083e8 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The deputy general director of the company “M3” was fined for distributing two films on the company's streaming service “More.tv”, labelled “16+”: “Three Many Weddings” (Javier Ruiz Caldera, 2013) and “Blow Dry” (Paddy Breathnach, 2001). In both films, experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, found  scenes “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations” among minors. In the first film, these scenes include the appearance of a transgender character and dialogs about transition (the exact time codes are 00:56:57-00:58:20, 00:58:21-00:58:52, 01:00:12-01:01:33, 01:01:34-01:02:10, 01:02:11-01:03:29, 01:04:14-01:04:22, 01:06:19-01:06:34, 01:10:32-01:11:00). In the second, there was one scene (01:21:47-01:21:57), in which “two characters of the same sex (female) kissing in a sexual context.”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:17203,
        p621:201765 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-940/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_0dfd46d0" .

p621:record_0e2832f3 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_a2cc091e ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_7 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0072 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_expulsion_b78285e6,
        p621:pen_fine_478e4294 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a video on the social media platform “Odnoklassniki”. The video, according to the court, “was aimed at forming non-traditional sexual relationships and preferences, and a distorted understanding of the social validity of traditional and non-traditional sexual relationships.” The case was brought to court by the police unit, which specialises in “fighting against ethnic criminal groups”. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_096 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-870/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:75 ;
    schema:identifier "record_0e2832f3" .

p621:record_0ecd256c a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_74037ed4 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_4 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0063 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_69b59500 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting the following text on Telegram: “Beloved, today is Transgender Visibility Day. Many people dear to my heart remain in Russia, and knowing their (and yours—you'll read it) wishes, I would say this: may the Russian authorities finally celebrate Transgender Visibility Day and stop this injustice. We once achieved visibility, rights, and an easy transition process. We will definitely achieve this again, much faster than the first time. Until then, may your visibility and noticeability be 110% under your control. Love.” According to the court, this post contained “information about non-traditional sexual relations”."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_085 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0646/374/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_0ecd256c" .

p621:record_0fc20352 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_2b22cab8 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_7 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0031 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_expulsion_530f8542,
        p621:pen_fine_7a05dd26 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on a website for trans women escorts. The court decision stated that the profile was “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual relations” because its creator, “being a male, writes about himself in the feminine gender”, and “posts photos in a female guise with exposed female breasts and male genitalia (penis), with dark long hair and makeup.”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:dating_profile_002 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-103/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_0fc20352" .

p621:record_10aad3e6 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_08b9f057 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0052 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a9ef22fc ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for a 15-second TikTok video. In this clip, the court described the defendant “wearing headphones, glasses, a white T-shirt and black jacket, moving to music while text appeared on screen”. The exact text is unknown. Officers testified that the original TikTok post had already been deleted, but the video spread to Telegram channels. The same individual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_111 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_bc832cac ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-295/87/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_10aad3e6" .

p621:record_125e5c3f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_ad82c9af ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0027 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_f10fce2d ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The deputy general director of the online streaming platform “Okko” was fined for distributing three TV series, labelled “16+”, which “contained a demonstration of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences”. In the TV series “Annika” (Nick Walker, 2021), court identified 4 scenes, in which characters “mention non-traditional sexual orientation”, and one of the scenes depicted two women kissing: 39:31-39:33 (episode 2); 38:26-38:45 (episode 4); 23:32-23:43 (episode 5); 00:28-00:30 (episode 6). In the series “The One and Only” (Moon Jung-min, 2021), the court mentioned 4 scenes, in one of them, a woman gently strokes the hand of another: 00:22:30-00:27:03, 00:45:45-00:46:00 (episode 9); 00:36:21-00:36:59 (episode 10); 00:17:05-00:18:38 (episode 11). In the series “My Dead Ex” (Drew Hancock, 2018), there were also four scenes mentioned, in which characters talk about “non-traditional sexual preferences”, women kissing, and a character comes out as a lesbian: 00:40-00:58 (episode 1); 14:40-15:11 (episode 4); 26:02-26:33 (episode 6); 15:56-17:20 (episode 8). The streaming platform was also fined for the same series (see case 5-253/2024)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:127008,
        p621:130273,
        p621:80840 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1423/2024-162" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:78 ;
    schema:identifier "record_125e5c3f" .

p621:record_128d33fe a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_76025011,
        p621:source_9acf7668 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1237700761539 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_ee10ab10 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "“MangaLib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was fined for publications on its website. The publication in this case is “Reincarnation Coliseum: The Weakest Skill Conquers the Strongest Women and Creates a Harem” (Harawata Saizou, 2022). From the court decision: “This material contains non-episodic depictions of non-traditional sexual relationships between characters who form a harem of women conquered by [the protagonist]. This depiction is represented by several illustrations of female characters in romantic and sexual contexts: touching, hugging, kissing, sex (including group sex), etc.”. The court stated that “the information displayed can be classified as revealing signs of a socio-cultural threat to the national security of the Russian Federation in terms of the protection of traditional values, since it reveals signs of ideological and psychological influence on the recipient in the form of the imposition of a destructive ideology (propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations).” This is one of at least 12 cases in a serial persecution of “MangaLib”. The manager of “MangaLib” was also prosecuted at least 12 times for different publications."@en,
        "“Мангалиб”, платформа онлайн-комиксов и манги, оштрафована за публикации на сайте. Публикация в этом деле – “Реинкарнация в колизее” (Harawata Saizou, 2022). Согласно постановлению эта публикация “содержит неэпизодическое изображение нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений между персонажами, составляющими гарем из побежденных [главным героем] девушек. Такое изображение представлено несколькими иллюстрациями лиц женского пола в романтическом и сексуальном контексте: прикосновения, объятия, поцелуи, секс (в том числе групповой) и т.д.” Суд также заявил, что информация в этой публикации “может быть квалифицирована как обнаруживающая признаки социокультурной угрозы национальной безопасности РФ в части, касающейся защиты традиционных ценностей, так как обнаруживает признаки идеологического и психологического воздействия на реципиента в виде насаждения деструктивной идеологии (пропаганды нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений).” Это одно из как минимум 12 дел против “Мангалиб”. Менеджер платформы также был оштрафован за различные публикации не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_006 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_08881344,
        p621:mentioned_in_27517825,
        p621:mentioned_in_3abdf6e4,
        p621:mentioned_in_93fb0552 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0606/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_128d33fe" .

p621:record_1423f46f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_088129c1 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0079 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_c7182db6 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "Igor Kochetkov, an LGBTQIA+ activist and the chair of the “Russian LGBT Network”, was fined for two posts on his Telegram channel. One post advertised an online poll for queer people; another was about the experiences of an LGBTQIA+ community resisting the state's repressive mechanisms. The judicial expertise found these posts to “contain information promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”. The court also stated that these posts contained “signs of a socio-cultural threat to the national security of the Russian Federation in terms of the protection of traditional values”. In April 2026, the “Russian LGBT Network” was designated an “extremist organisation”."@en,
        "Игорь Кочетков, ЛГБТКИА+ активист и председатель “Российской ЛГБТ-сети”, был оштрафован за две публикации в своем Телеграм-канале. Одна публикация призывала пройти онлайн-опрос для квир-людей, другая рассказывала об опыте квир-сообщества сопротивляться репрессивным механизмам. Судебная экспертиза установила, что эти публикации “содержат информацию, пропагандирующую нетрадиционные сексуальные отношения и (или) предпочтения”. Суд также заявил, что информация в этих публикациях “может быть квалифицирована как обнаруживающая признаки социокультурной угрозы национальной безопасности Российской Федерации в части, касающейся защиты традиционных ценностей”. В апреле 2026 года “Российская ЛГБТ-сеть” была признана “экстремистской организацией”."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_120,
        p621:social_media_648581ef ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_95ab215d ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1201/2025-150" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:78 ;
    schema:identifier "record_1423f46f" .

p621:record_1425ee78 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_5811dc99 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0071 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_efe5390d ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "Two women were fined for “propaganda of non-traditional sexual preferences” because they “publicly kissed in a nightclub, showing signs of sexual attraction” (see also case 5-20/2025)."@en,
        "Две женщины были оштрафованы за “пропаганду нетрадиционных сексуальных предпочтений” за то, что они публично целовались в ночном клубе, “проявляя признаки сексуального влечения” (см. также дело 5-20/2025)."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:public_action_004 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-21/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:23 ;
    schema:identifier "record_1425ee78" .

p621:record_1464fe6f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_eabc6bee ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0104 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_4fa6314e ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting “a voice message, accompanied by a video recording, which depicts two women kissing” on Telegram. The judicial expert concluded that the content “presented same-sex female love in an attractive way (this is the type of relationship preferred by bloggers, fashionable and stylish-looking attractive modern women who live in stylish interiors);” and that it presented “non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman) [...] in an attractive manner.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown. The post is dated 08.02.2025. The same individual was fined at least six times on the same day by the same judge for posting similar content on Telegram and Instagram."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_090 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_e841c2de ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-0436/222/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_1464fe6f" .

p621:record_14d43d58 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_0d0dcefa,
        p621:source_16cc6dbc,
        p621:source_cc11cb8a ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1167847381130 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a3cca642 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The online streaming platform “Okko” was fined for 16 films. According to the Head of the St. Petersburg courts press office, the court found “bad things” in the following films: “The Miseducation of Cameron Post” (Desiree Akhavan, 2018), “Bridget Jones: The Edge of Reason” (Beeban Kidron, 2004), “Perfect Strangers” (Paolo Genovese, 2016), “Three Many Weddings” (Javier Ruiz Caldera, 2013), “Black Swan” (Darren Aronofsky, 2010), “The New Mutants” (Josh Boone, 2020), “Blow Dry” (Paddy Breathnach, 2001), “Easy A” (Will Gluck, 2010), “Zwanger & Co” (Johan Nijenhuis, 2022), “Clouds of Sils Maria” (Olivier Assayas, 2014), “Breaking Up in Rome” (Edoardo Leo, 2021), “The Imitation Game” (Morten Tyldum, 2014), “Little Italy” (Donald Petrie, 2018), “Alexander” (Oliver Stone, 2004), “Love Is Love Is Love” (Eleanor Coppola, 2021), and “The Royal Tenenbaums” (Wes Anderson, 2001). It is unknown what scenes exactly in these films constituted the violation."@en ;
