    dataout:hasSnippet "The music channel “Muz‑TV” was fined after its 2021 awards show broadcast featured celebrities who, according to the court, “did not correspond to the image of a man of a traditional sexual orientation.” The court mentioned Filipp Kirkorov and Dava surrounded by shirtless men, Alexey Zhidkovsky “demonstrating traditional feminine characteristics”, and another person [Igor Sinyak] “in a women's evening dress with a train.”"@en ;
