    dataout:hasSnippet "The company, which owns the streaming service “Megafon TV”, was fined for the film “Love Is Love Is Love” (Eleanor Coppola, 2021), labelled “16+”. According to the court, the film “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, which is prohibited for distribution among children.” It is not specified which scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en ;
