    dataout:hasSnippet "An Uzbekistan citizen was detained for one day and ordered to leave the country for publishing a profile on a website for sex services. According to the court, on this website, this individual “carried out propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences for sex change, committed among minors.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en ;
