    dataout:hasSnippet "The company that owns the streaming service “Ivi” was fined for the film “Perfect Strangers” (Paolo Genovese, 2016), labelled “16+”, because it “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences.” It is not specified which scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en ;
