p621:record_3b63e42f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_195f88a8 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0052 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_cfa599d3 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for a video published on TikTok. According to the court, this video “promoted non-traditional sexual relations” and depicted “a young man with headphones on, long hair, glasses in a black T-shirt, and text over it”; “[the defendant] himself is present in the video, [...] moving to the music”. It is not said what text was on the video. The same indivudual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_108 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_bc832cac ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-296/87/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_3b63e42f" .

p621:record_3e86b8ad a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_3cda38d5 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0017 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_79ef4bd2 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the music TV channel “La Minor TV” was fined for airing the music video “Город” (“The City”, 2013) by the band “Tantsy Minus”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, determined that the music video “contains scenes of affection and tactile gestures, as well as scenes of kissing between two persons of the same biological sex (female), therefore contains information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences.” The judicial expertise also involved the analysis of the kiss scene. The experts applied the so-called “classification of kisses”, which includes “social and sensual kisses, the latter differing depending on the types of feelings (kisses of affection, tenderness, respect and kisses of love).” The company that owns the TV channel was also fined for the same music video (see case 05-6777/2023)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:NcfFV9eesZI ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1073/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_3e86b8ad" .

p621:record_3f2d2764 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_fe1ad366 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0012 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_274d73e6 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the “KinoLiving” TV channel was fined after Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, found that the TV channel aired the series “Made in Italy” (Camilla Nesbitt, 2019). According to Roskomnadzor, “the series contained images that touch on the topic of non-traditional sexual relations (kisses between two people of the same biological sex (male), as well as dialogue between the characters that touches on the topic of non-traditional sexual relations.” The company that owns the TV channel was also fined for the same content (case 05-1133/2023)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:94115 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1001/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_3f2d2764" .

p621:record_3fddb099 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_b8f7dba9 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_4 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0031 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_642d7404 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “Boo! It’s Sex” (Danielle Corsetto, Monica Gallagher, 2018). According to the court, this is a comic book “dedicated to the depiction of love and romantic relationships between girls (kisses, hugs, sensitive touches),” which “contains information promoting non-traditional sexual relationships and (or) preferences.” This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en,
        "Менеджер проектов “Мангалиб”, платформы онлайн-комиксов и манги, был привлечён к ответственности за несколько публикаций. Публикация в этом деле – “Буу! Это секс / Boo! It’s Sex” (Danielle Corsetto, Monica Gallagher, 2018). Согласно суду это комикс, “посвящённый изображению любви и романтических отношений между девушками (поцелуи, объятия, чувствительные прикосновения)”, в котором “присутствует информация, пропагандирующая нетрадиционные сексуальные отношения и (или) предпочтения”. Это должностное лицо было оштрафовано за различные публикации не менее 12 раз. ООО “Мангалиб” также была оштрафована не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_013 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_27517825,
        p621:mentioned_in_7b4e742c ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0751/374/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_3fddb099" .

p621:record_3fe4e07f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_192cd2cb ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1067746687623 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a7682a3c ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "“RED Media” was fined for broadcasting the music video “Город” (“The City”) by the band “Tantsy Minus” (2013) to minors on its TV channel “La Minor TV”. According to the court, it “contained material demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations”. Rejecting the defence argument that the video merely depicted friendship and affection for Russian cities, the court focused on a scene where one female character, in its words, “sensually interacts with another female person”, treating that moment as the central evidentiary basis for liability. The judgment also moved beyond ordinary legal description by offering an extended semiotic reading of the clip, calling it a “polycode (creolised) text”, discussing “clip culture”, and interpreting the montage as a symbolic narrative of memory, emotion, and desire before concluding that same-sex intimacy embedded in that audiovisual sequence could not lawfully remain classified as suitable for children aged twelve and above."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:NcfFV9eesZI ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-6777/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_3fe4e07f" .

p621:record_3fff70fd a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_792c4f49,
        p621:source_932ba6d9 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0077 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_abd0b352 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing a picture of “two women, one of whom is kissing the other, and symbols similar to those of the extremist organisation 'LGBT movement'” in 2019. The court described the content of the picture: “in the lower left corner are two women, one of whom is kneeling, holding a rose in her left hand and placing a ring on the other woman's finger; in the upper right corner, one women is kissing the other women on the cheek; in the left corner, [...] there is a pattern of stripes [...] red, orange, yellow, green, blue, and purple; in the lower right corner, [...] there is the text 'yes, I am from Russia'.” The judicial expert concluded that the picture depicts positevely “non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman), [...] it is expressed visually (the viewer is shown that it is beautiful, youthful, fashionable, modern, daring, informal, it is a challenge and therefore good and acceptable); [...] sexual relations not between a man and a woman are presented as acceptable for public display on an equal basis with heterosexual relations”. The exact picture is unknown. The same individual was fined five times on the same day by the same court for publishing pictures on VK. The media reported that the first-instance court imposed a 100,000 RUB fine for each case. The higher-instance court reduced the fine, but the amount is unknown."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_055 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "12-2087/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_3fff70fd" .

p621:record_40142de8 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_39122cc9 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0026 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_3f0f38b1 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for posting images “containing persons of the same sex (gender)”. According to the court, these images were the “signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, propaganda of norms of non-traditional sexual relations”. It is not specified which images exactly constituted the violation. This individual was fined nine times by the same judge for posting images on VK."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_026 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_24d3b74b ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-308/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:23 ;
