    dataout:hasSnippet "The TV channel “TV 1000 Comedy” was fined for showing the film “American Pie 2” (J.B. Rogers, 2001). According to the court, it “promoted non-traditional sexual relationships” because of the scene with “two naked women kissing”."@en ;
