p621:record_46a753b8 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_c905024f ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0027 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_5a46ff7b ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The deputy general director of the online streaming platform “Okko” was fined for distributing the film “Yves Saint Laurent” (Jalil Lespert, 2014). The court described 23 scenes in this film “touching on the topic of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences”. Among these scenes are dialogs, “nonverbal prolonged glances”, kissing, hugging, and sexual interaction between “persons of the same biological sex”. The judicial expertise stated that the film presented “non-traditional sexual relationships as a basic condition for the development of a fashion designer's talent and the success of a fashion house, thereby aestheticizing non-traditional sexual relationships.” The time codes of the scenese mentioned by the court are: 00:09:27-00:10:35, 00:20:22-00:21:12, 00:22:14-00:23:25, 00:23:07-00:23:13, 00:14:25-00:14:30, 00:23:38-00:23:56, 00:26:15-00:26:28, 00:26:31-00:26:43, 00:29:52-00:30:52, 00:31:08-00:32:02, 00:42:29-00:42:41, 00:43:53-00:44:18, 00:49:49-00:50:29, 00:57:53-00:58:13, 00:58:18-00:58:20, 00:59:59-01:00:24, 01:03:34-01:04:27, 01:10:06-01:10:55, 01:14:21-01:15:05, 01:15:25-01:16:21, 01:17:10-01:18:19, 01:18:48- 01:19:09, 01:20:09-01:21:19."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:245775 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-837/2024-162" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:78 ;
    schema:identifier "record_46a753b8" .

p621:record_46fceefa a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_2d085a09 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:5137746045620 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_60f16dde ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The TV channel “TOCHKA TV” was fined for airing the music video “Stranger” (2012) by Nikolai Baskov, labelled “16+”. The court stated that this video “contained information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” and should have had the label “18+”. The experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified six scenes in the music video, which show a relationship story between two men placed in the “atmosphere of hedonism and debauchery, which is realised primarily through repeated scenes of non-verbal sensual interaction between two persons of the same biological sex (female) in a sexual context.” The editor-in-chief of this TV channel was also fined for the same content (see case 5-998/23)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:aH4080sT4P8 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-6771/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_46fceefa" .

p621:record_47427112 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_a68b21e5 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0078 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_3c2b98b8 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A moderator of a VKontakte page was fined, becasue the page “contained text, images, audio, and video […] prohibited for distribution among children, namely, information aimed at denying traditional spiritual, moral, and family values and promoting non-traditional sexual relations”, according to the court. The judicial expertise concluded: “the main theme of this webpage is the recognition of the normality and equivalence of sexual relations between a man and a man, in connection with which indirect signs of distorted ideas about the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations are present.” In court, the defendant explained that this VK page was about dating among homosexual people. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_009 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2020"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-262/2020-198" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:78 ;
    schema:identifier "record_47427112" .

p621:record_478ac327 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_65fd1ea2,
        p621:source_6842710c ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0108 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_2942a037 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An admin of a VKontakte page about gay dating was fined for “propaganda among minors of non-traditional sexual relations”. According to the mass media, the individual administered the VK page until 2010, and the content was posted to the page by its members. Other details of the case are unknown; the court did not publish the decision."@en ;
