p621:record_4f35a8c4 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_aedf51da ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1087746540705 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_31549362 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The TV channel “Eurokino” was fined for broadcasting “French Women” (2014, Audrey Dana). The court found that the film contained material classified as “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and preferences”. According to the ruling, the broadcaster had committed “the dissemination among minors of information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, including description and depiction of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences.” The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling."@en ;
