    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_ef73dca7 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the TV channel “ZHARA TV” was fined for airing the music video “Girls” (2018) by Rita Ora, Cardi B, Bebe Rexha, and Сharli ХСХ. The court stated that the music video should have had the label “18+” instead of “16+”, because it “contains information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, [...] prohibited for distribution among children.”"@en ;
