p621:record_599a93d6 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_688f2479 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1077758948112 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_dd1b9018 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The streaming platform “IVI” was fined for distributing the South Korean TV series “The One and Only” (2021). The court held that the series contained scenes “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations through the backstory of two female characters whose past romantic attachment is gradually revealed through memory scenes, dialogue, and visual detail”. According to the ruling, prohibited content included scenes in which one woman “gently strokes the hand” of another, memories of how the two women once planned “to leave together for one of the European countries so that they could avoid hiding their relationship from others,” and a later confrontation in which one character openly states: “We loved each other.” The court further stressed that “the totality of all the above-listed scenes … helps the recipient create a picture of non-traditional sexual relations,” and concluded that, given “the systemic thinking of the recipient,” these fragments constituted prohibited demonstration of same-sex relations."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:127008 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0796/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_599a93d6" .

p621:record_5b4f74a4 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_51cb5b7f,
        p621:source_e4027999 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1027700166636 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_376b8d92 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The company “VimpelCom”, which owns the streaming service “Beeline TV”, was fined for three films: “Perfect Strangers” (Paolo Genovese, 2016), “Blow Dry” (Paddy Breathnach, 2001), and “Easy A” (Will Gluck, 2010), all labelled “16+”. According to the judicial expertise, in “Perfect Strangers”, there are “scenes demonstrating (describing) homosexual relations between men, as well as mentions of homosexual relations”, although the exact scenes are not specified. In “Blow Dry”, the experts found the scene with the time code 01:21:45-01:22:01, in which “two characters of the same sex (female) are depicted kissing in a sexual context.” In “Easy A”, the scene 01:23:17-01:23:33 “depicted non-traditional sexual relations (of men), as well as multiple references to a representative of non-traditional sexual orientation.”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:17203,
        p621:37735,
        p621:381341 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_8d833dfb ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-1409/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_5b4f74a4" .

p621:record_5c3f1784 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_2ac2f627,
        p621:source_93efdef0 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0074 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_ccd75d77 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting videos and pictures on VKontakte and Telegram. The court provided six links to Telegram posts and two to VK posts. The judicial experts identified in the videos “a combination of linguistic and psychological features promoting non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman), which is expressed by a positive assessment of such relations as correct, justifying the need for sexual relations not between a man and a woman.” The experts characterised the pictures as “erotic”, which were used by the defendant to “promote the ideas of LGBT”. The exact videos and pictures are no longer available online."@en,
        "Физическое лицо оштрафовано за публикацию видео и изображений во ВКонтакте и Телеграме. Суд привел шесть ссылок на публикации в Телеграме и две — на публикации в ВК. Судебные эксперты выявили в видео “совокупность лингвистических и психологических признаков пропаганды нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений (не между мужчиной и женщиной), что выражено положительной оценкой таких отношений как правильных, обоснованием необходимости сексуальных отношений не между мужчиной и женщиной”. Эксперты упомянули, что изображения были “эротического содержания, в которых [ответчик] распространяет идеи ЛГБТ”. Ссылки на посты больше не доступны в социальных сетях."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_061e61a8,
        p621:social_media_112,
