    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for posting images “containing persons of the same sex (gender)”. According to the court, these images were the “signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, propaganda of norms of non-traditional sexual relations”. The defence argued that the images were screenshots of publicly available music videos and films. It is not specified which images exactly constituted the violation. This individual was fined nine times by the same judge for posting images on VK."@en ;
