    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for posting screenshots of the film “Tell It to the Bees” (Annabel Jankel, 2019). The court stated that “it can be reliably determined that the images contain persons of the same sex (gender), therefore there are signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, propaganda of norms of non-traditional sexual relations among minors”. This individual was fined nine times by the same judge for posting images on VK."@en ;
