p621:record_6abad1c8 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_a5b18f03 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0045 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_50ede1b7 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting a video on Telegram of himself climbing on a sculpture group “Metrostroevtsy” and kissing a male figure on the lips, which authorities qualified as the dissemination of information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations. According to the judicial expertise, “the said video contains signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual preferences, namely sexual relations directed at an inanimate object, as well as a realistic depiction of a person of the same sex as the participant in the action.”"@en ;
