p621:record_6ac106d9 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_3313584a ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1027700198767 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a7b7bfdd ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The company “Rostelecom”, a digital services provider, was fined for distributing four films on its streaming platform “Wink” with the age restriction label “16+”. According to the court, these films contained “information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences.” One of the mentioned films is the sci-fi thriller “Life Like” (Josh Janowicz, 2019). Other titles were redacted in the court decision. It is not specified what scenes exactly constituted the violation."@en ;
