    dataout:hasSnippet "The streaming service “Kinopoisk” was fined for the film “Love” (Gaspar Noé, 2015). The judge stated that the “the propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations in the feature film is expressed through the formation of a positive image of people in non-traditional sexual relations.” The exact scenes that constituted the violation are not specified."@en ;
