p621:record_77659b8d a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_302f3c35 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0031 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_e286cb77 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is the manga “Fujoshi Haru-chan wa Osake Suki” (Yasai, 2018), which “depicted romantic and/or sexual relationships between men”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en,
        "Менеджер проектов “Мангалиб”, платформы онлайн-комиксов и манги, был привлечён к ответственности за несколько публикаций. Публикация в этом деле – “Фудзоси Хару-тян любит выпить” (Yasai, 2018), в которой “изображаются романтические и/или сексуальные отношения между мужчинами”. Это должностное лицо было оштрафовано за различные публикации не менее 12 раз. ООО “Мангалиб” также была оштрафована не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_004 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_2354c824 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0674/374/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_77659b8d" .

p621:record_7bd56650 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_0edab8b3 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1027739148656 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_d0f45b92 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The publishing house “Eksmo” was fined for publishing and circulating the book “Pigeon” (Koro, 2021). An individual found this book in a public library and handed it over to the police. The court cited a linguistic report stating that the text “contains discussion of non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman)” and highlighted the age marking “12+” as proof that the text was addressed to readers over twelve. The report noted “references to young men in the description of pigeons,” “a man in the description of one pigeon,” and “men represented through the image of a pigeon and a crow.” A further expert interview characterised the book as mass-distribution printed material aimed, among others, at minors, and claimed that it used “a manipulative strategy of influence,” with “indirect, hidden psychological impact.” The same opinion concluded that the book promoted “a positive emotional-semantic attitude toward non-traditional relations, presented as normal, ordinary, generally accepted, that is, natural,” while allegedly producing a negative emotional attitude toward traditional family and sexual relations."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_001 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_148183da,
        p621:mentioned_in_35f39c00 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-1635/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_7bd56650" .

p621:record_7c555084 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_bf4eb708 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0095 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_ce17b729 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing a picture in 2018, which depicted “kissing women bathing together half-naked in a bathtub.” As the judicial expert concluded, this image “contained psychological and linguistic signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations, expressed in attracting interest and forming sexual attitudes towards non-traditional sexual relations.” The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling. The same individual was fined by the same judge on the same day at least twice for pictures on VK (see also 5-0265/2025)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_068 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-0264/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_7c555084" .

p621:record_7cc96737 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_b74e846e ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_7 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0016 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_expulsion_057abc3a,
        p621:pen_fine_68ff9bf1 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A foreign national was fined and ordered to leave the country for posting a profile on the trans women escort website. The court decision states that the profile was “aimed at developing non-traditional sexual relations” because its creator, “being a male, posts photos of himself in female guise, specifically in women's clothing (a skirt), with signs of female breasts, with long blond hair, makeup, and with exposed male genitalia (penis).”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:dating_profile_004 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-210/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_7cc96737" .

p621:record_8117bac8 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_2a2d710c,
        p621:source_48bdf8c6 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1117746765311 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_0170b05a ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The film distribution company “Russian Report” was fined for airing the TV series “Made in Italy” (Camilla Nesbitt, 2019) on the “KinoLiving” TV channel with the label “16+”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, found that the fifth episode of the TV series “contained information (visual) consistent with the signs of demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, [...] conveyed through verbal and visual components: the address ‘honey’ [...] and displyas of a kiss and hug”, which, according to the court, is prohibited to distribute among minors."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:94115 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_40c02aa5 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-1133/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_8117bac8" .

p621:record_819c2bb0 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_75c236a2 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1071200001212 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_670c39a8 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A youth organisation was fined for screening the film “The Whale” (Darren Arranofski, 2022) during a movie night organised for adolescents. A judicial expert determined that this film “creates a distorted impression of the equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations.” According to the expert, “the theme of non-traditional sexual relations is not emphasised in this film; its main plot does not include love scenes, kisses, or attempts at physical seduction. However, this theme is presented as an important plot element.” The description of the exact scenes was redacted in the court decision."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:785084 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-120/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:12 ;
    schema:identifier "record_819c2bb0" .

p621:record_82742d5b a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_2fbfc2d6 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0057 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_83eda3b7 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for content posted on a VKontakte profile that was flagged during police monitoring and classified as online promotion of “non-traditional sexual relations”. The exact image is unclear."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_061 ;
