    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1097746038741 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_55ab18a7 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The TV channel “My Zen TV” aired an episode of the programme “Love in the city” about Mexico, which included an interview with a choreographer and founder of the dance troupe “La Cebra Danza Gay” who said: “It doesn't matter if you're gay, bisexual, transgender, or a cross-dresser. People fall in love no matter their preferences. Love is free.” According to the court, these and other fragments of the interview constituted the “promotion of non-traditional sexual relationships” among minors."@en ;
