    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_8de02b67 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting on a Telegram channel. The court stated that the user “being male, repeatedly posted photos and videos of himself in women's clothing and makeup, and videos of himself engaging in non-traditional sexual acts with another male”, which constituted the “promotion of non-traditional sexual relations and preferences or sex change.”"@en ;
