p621:record_c13a3ebb a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_c9fc87bc ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1026700647885 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a4b462a9 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "“Kometa-Plus”, the manufacturer of the board game “Forfeits”, was fined for “dissemination of information aimed at developing non-traditional sexual attitudes in minors”, according to the court. As the judicial expertise stated, “individual elements of the game [...] directly and indirectly promote homosexuality”. The game asked the players to roleplay different situations, such as “Pretend to be a same-sex couple on a date” and “Portray a man-loving Rambo” (text on the chips). Earlier, the general director of the company was also fined for distributing the same board game (see case 12-28/2014)."@en,
        "“Комета-Плюс”, компания-производитель настольной игры “Фанты”, была оштрафована за “распространение информации, направленной на формирование у несовершеннолетних нетрадиционных сексуальных установок”, согласно суду. Как заключила судебная экспертиза, “отдельные элементы игры [...] непосредственным и опосредованным способом пропагандируют гомосексуализм”. Игра предлагала разыгрывать различные ситуации, такие как “Изобразите свидание однополой пары” или “Изобразите любящего мужчин Рэмбо” (текст на фишках). Директор этой комании также была оштрафована за эту игру (см. дело 12-28/2014)."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:merch_005 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2014"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "7-149/2014" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:67 ;
    schema:identifier "record_c13a3ebb" .

p621:record_c2270492 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_83dc80b2 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0030 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a469721f ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The director general of the company “Restrim Media” that owns the streaming service “Wink” was fined for making the films “Bridget Jones: The Edge of Reason” (Beeban Kidron, 2004), “Curse of Chucky” (Don Mancini, 2013), and “Blow Dry” (2001, Paddy Breathnach) publicly acessible to minors, because they were labelled “16+”. According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, these films “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, such as passionate kissing between two women, a scene where women are about to engage in virtual sex via video call.” Earlier, the company was also fined for the same films (see case 05-0486/2023)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:167032,
        p621:17203,
        p621:9801 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-881/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_c2270492" .

p621:record_c239abae a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_6cf0e308,
        p621:source_fdca0fd4 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0046 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_e267d6a2 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An LGBTQIA+ activist was fined for posts on VKontakte. The court stated that these posts “contained propaganda of non-traditional same-sex sexual relations aimed at forming attractiveness [to such relations].” According to the mass media, the posts were six pictures, “two of which depicted LGBT flags, another picture had a drawing of boys kissing, and the rest of the images were rainbow-colored.”"@en,
        "ЛГБТКИА+ активистка была оштрафована за публикации во ВКонтакте. Суд указал, что эти публикации содержали “пропаганду нетрадиционных однополых сексуальных отношений, направленную на формирование привлекательности [к таким отношениям]”. По данным СМИ, в этих постах было шесть изображений, “на двоих из них были флаги ЛГБТ, на еще одном снимке — рисунок с целующимися мальчиками, остальные изображения были окрашены цвета радуги”."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_043 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-1059/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_c239abae" .

p621:record_c282acec a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_183e6b24,
        p621:source_792c4f49 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0077 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_f82c4763 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing a meme in 2019: “a picture depicting a cat holding a flag in its mouth; The flag consists of six stripes, the colors of which run from top to bottom: red, orange, yellow, green, blue, and purple; At the bottom of the photograph is the text 'naturalu po ***(expletive)' ['smack a straight guy in the face'].” The court mentioned tha tthe flag was a “symbol of the extremist organisation 'LGBT movement'”. The judicial expert concluded that the picture depicts positevely “non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman), which is expressed through a call to action to defend non-traditional relationships against the 'straights' as worthy of being recognized and valued more highly than 'straight' relationships; [...] sexual relationships not between a man and a woman are presented as acceptable for the forceful assertion of one's right to them against heterosexuals.” The same individual was fined five times on the same day by the same court for publishing pictures on VK. The media reported that the first-instance court imposed a 100,000 RUB fine for each case. The higher-instance court reduced the fine, but the amount is unknown."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_054 ;
