    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_dc9d9597 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The company “A Serial”, which owns the streaming service “Amediateka”, was fined for showing the first season of the series “Gentleman Jack” (Sally Wainwright, 2019). According to the court, the series “contained information promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences”. The exact scenes that constituted the violation are not specified."@en ;
