    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_36222844 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The streaming platform “Kinopoisk” was fined for the TV series “Supergirl” (Greg Berlanti, 2015), which, according to the court, contained scenes of “non-traditional sexual relations”. The exact scenes that constituted the violation are not specified."@en ;
