    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_4ccc8f10 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for “publishing the status 'TPerson' with a colored emblem of the LGBT flag” on social media. According to the court's press office, the judicial expertise concluded that the defendant “publicly displayed an illustration of the LGBT flag, which could be perceived by social media users as propaganda for sex change.”"@en ;
