    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0099 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_2e31cecd ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "According to the media, a Ukrainian national was fined for promoting “non-traditional sexual relations” online. This individual has already faced pressure from the authorities before for criticising the quality of roads in the Volgograd region. The details of the case are unknown. The court did not publish the text of the court decision."@en ;
