p621:record_d4df5fc7 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_11f61fe5,
        p621:source_19b26bd1,
        p621:source_7355a63a,
        p621:source_8e1340e0 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0115 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_5cf663e9 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual who attended a drag performance at a Halloween party in the nightclub “Dark Horse” in Yaroslavl  was fined after the police raided the club. The details of this case are unknown; the court did not publish the decision. The defendant appealed, but the decision was upheld by the Leninsky District Court of Yaroslavl (case 12-70/2025). The mass media reported that during the raid, the police forced the club's visitors to lie on the floor for several hours; some people were beaten; several performers were detained, and seven administrative cases were initiated. We found eight such cases on the court website, six of which resulted in a punishment. This is one of these cases."@en,
        "Участник Хэллоуин вечеринки, во время которой проходило дрэг-шоу, в ночном клубе “Dark Horse” в Ярославле был оштрафован после полицейского рейда в этом клубе. Детали этого дела неизвестны; суд не опубликовал решение. Ответчик подал аппелляцию, но Ленинский районный суда Ярославля оставил решение в силе (дело 12-70/2025). СМИ сообщили, что во время рейда полицейские заставили посетителей клуба пролежать на полу несколько часов; некоторых людей били; некоторые артисты были задержаны, и было возбуждено семь административных дел. На сайте суда мы нашли восемь таких дел, по шести из ним были вынесены наказания. Это одно из них."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:public_action_014 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-526/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:76 ;
    schema:identifier "record_d4df5fc7" .

p621:record_d6a0a1ff a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_c5caec32 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0023 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_ceef7bad ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The general director and editor-in-chief of the TV channel “EuroKino” was fined for airing the film “French Women” (Audrey Dana, 2014), labelled “16+”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, found the film to contain “information demonstrating non-traditional sexual relationships and/or preferences, which is expressed by a verbal component (dialogues between two women), a visual component: an image of sensual interaction between two women, where scenes are shown containing tactile communication after sexual interaction, prolonged kisses.” The company, which owns the TV channel, was also fined for the same film (see case 05-0835/2023)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:273169 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_e1ea8dd4 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-999/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_d6a0a1ff" .

p621:record_d6f20fee a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_018ec8ae ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0031 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_26f67e17 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The title of the publication in this case has been redacted from the ruling, but the court stated that it depicted romantic and sexual interaction between male characters. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en,
        "Менеджер проектов “Мангалиб”, платформы онлайн-комиксов и манги, был привлечён к ответственности за несколько публикаций. Суд скрыл название публикации в этом деле, но установил, что публикация содержала “неэпизодическое изображение нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений между персонажами мужского пола в романтическом и сексуальном контексте: объятия, прикосновения, сексуальное взаимодействие”. Это должностное лицо было оштрафовано за различные публикации не менее 12 раз. ООО “Мангалиб” также была оштрафована не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_015 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_27517825,
        p621:mentioned_in_7b4e742c ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0753/374/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_d6f20fee" .

p621:record_d7c7427f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_c529a745 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0064 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_525e0b49 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing “a semi-nude photograph of two men embracing.” In this image, the judicial experts identified “linguistic and psychological signs of propaganda for non-traditional sexual relations [...] expressed in the display of love and sexual scenes between two men in an aesthetically appealing manner with the aim of arousing interest in such contacts.” The exact images are unclear; the profile has been deleted. This individual was fined at least three times by the same judge on the same day for posting on VKontakte and was also detained for 15 days for posting images depicting rainbow flags, which the court deemed as “public demonstration of extremist symbols” (article 20.3)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_115 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-0760/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_d7c7427f" .

p621:record_d845c31c a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_8dcbc44d ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0065 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_793fb510 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing an image, which the court described as “depicting four situations, where in the first there is a seated person looking at a monitor and reading 'straight gay', in the last part, there is an LGBT flag.” According to the court, this image “was aimed at promoting LGBT and non-traditional sexual orientation.” The exact image is unknown. The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling. This individual was fined four times by the same judge on the same day for posting on VK."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_104 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_421931e3 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0627/2025" ;
