p621:record_e11f1a0d a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_338be2ea ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0007 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_7afdd221 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A school principal was fined for a banner dedicated to International Tolerance Day placed in the school hallway. The photo of this banner was published on Telegram, which led to an investigation. One of the pieces of evidence the court admitted was a “comprehensive psycho-cultural examination”, which found the banner made by students to contain “symbols of LGBD-community” and “signs of promotion of non-traditional sexual relations among minors.”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_014 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2022"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-177/22" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e11f1a0d" .

p621:record_e185fbee a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_9083569d ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0003 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_d92dd186 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the newspaper “Tvoi den'” was fined for publishing the article “I don't consider sex with a girlfriend to be cheating on my husband”, discussing romantic and sexual relationships between women, which authorities classified as inappropriate for distribution to minors and treated as unlawful promotion of same-sex relationships."@en,
        "Газета “Твой день” опубликовала статью “Секс с подружкой я не считаю изменой мужу” (номер 143), в которой обсуждались романтические и сексуальные отношения между женщинами, которые власти квалифицировали как неподходящие для распространения среди несовершеннолетних и расценили как незаконную пропаганду однополых отношений."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:mass_media_004 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2015"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "12-4105/2015" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e185fbee" .

p621:record_e19ea204 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_11f61fe5,
        p621:source_4acb9d29,
        p621:source_7355a63a,
        p621:source_8e1340e0 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0112 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_cb10775d ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual who attended a drag performance at a Halloween party in the nightclub “Dark Horse” in Yaroslavl  was fined after the police raided the club. The details of this case are unknown; the court did not publish the decision. The defendant appealed, but the decision was upheld by the Leninsky District Court of Yaroslavl (case 12-71/2025). The mass media reported that during the raid, the police forced the club's visitors to lie on the floor for several hours; some people were beaten; several performers were detained, and seven administrative cases were initiated. We found eight such cases on the court website, six of which resulted in a punishment. This is one of these cases."@en,
        "Участник Хэллоуин вечеринки, во время которой проходило дрэг-шоу, в ночном клубе “Dark Horse” в Ярославле был оштрафован после полицейского рейда в этом клубе. Детали этого дела неизвестны; суд не опубликовал решение. Ответчик подал апелляцию, но Ленинский районный суд Ярославля оставил решение в силе (дело 12-71/2025). СМИ сообщили, что во время рейда полицейские заставили посетителей клуба пролежать на полу несколько часов; некоторых людей били; некоторые артисты были задержаны, и было возбуждено семь административных дел. На сайте суда мы нашли восемь таких дел, по шести из ним были вынесены наказания. Это одно из них."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:public_action_011 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-530/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:76 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e19ea204" .

p621:record_e1ab2ef5 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_02a4ca52,
        p621:source_11f61fe5,
        p621:source_17b1b1b2,
        p621:source_8e1340e0,
        p621:source_8fed73c3 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0110 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_4b2e8a87 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A drag performer was fined after the police raided the nightclub “Dark Horse” in Yaroslavl. The court stated that the defendant “wore women's clothing and feminine makeup, demonstrating his appearance to an indefinite number of people, thereby committing public actions aimed at developing non-traditional sexual attitudes”. In court, the performer explained that he was detained while on stage and that his costume symbolised the Coronavirus because it was a Halloween party. The defendant appealed the first-instance decision twice (Magistrate Court No. 3 of the Leninsky Judicial District of Yaroslavl). However, both instances upheld it. The mass media reported that during the raid, the police forced the club's visitors to lie on the floor for several hours; some people were beaten; several performers were detained, and seven administrative cases were initiated. We found eight such cases on the court website, six of which resulted in a punishment. This is one of these cases."@en,
        "Артист дрэг-шоу был оштрафован после полицейского рейда в ночном клубе “Dark Horse” в Ярославле. Согласно суду подзащитный “носил женскую одежду и женский макияж на лице, демонстрируя свой внешний вид неопределенному кругу лиц, тем самым совершил публичные действия, направленные на формирование нетрадиционных сексуальных установок”. В суде артист объяснил, что был задержан на сцене в момент исполнения номера и что его костюм символизировал Коронавирус, потому что это была Хэллоуин вечеринка. Ответчик обжаловал решение первой инстанции дважды (Судебный участок 3 Ленинского судебного района г. Ярославля), однако обе инстанции оставили его без изменений. СМИ сообщили, что во время рейда полицейские заставили посетителей клуба пролежать на полу несколько часов; некоторых людей били; некоторые артисты были задержаны, и было возбуждено семь административных дел. На сайте суда мы нашли восемь таких дел, по шести из ним были вынесены наказания. Это одно из них."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:public_action_009 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_19cd83fe,
        p621:mentioned_in_3c07b0fd,
        p621:mentioned_in_b96af833 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "16-1545/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:76 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e1ab2ef5" .

p621:record_e3ed6727 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_df3ad2a2 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0104 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_71ca2880 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting “a voice message, accompanied by a video recording, which depicts two women kissing” on Telegram. The judicial expert concluded that the content “presented same-sex female love in an attractive way (this is the type of relationship preferred by bloggers, fashionable and stylish-looking attractive modern women who live in stylish interiors);” and that it presented “non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman) [...] in an attractive manner.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown. The post is dated 06.02.2025. The same individual was fined at least six times on the same day by the same judge for posting similar content on Telegram and Instagram."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_087 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_e841c2de ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-0441/222/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e3ed6727" .

p621:record_e45b5392 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_f27da929 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0025 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_645feddd ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the TV channel “TV-3 Russia” was fined for airing the film “Piranha 3D” (Alexandre Aja, 2010) twice with the label “16+”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified two scenes in the film “demonstrating non-traditional sexual relations” among minors: “a girl licking salt off another girl’s body and a prolonged kiss expressing sexual passion (timestamps 00:51:10–00:51:28 and 00:55:21–00:55:39).”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:43593 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-628/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e45b5392" .

p621:record_e4b3d13d a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_94c0d85d ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0044 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_8517d6b5 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined after inspectors documented that she had posted on her VKontakte profile an image depicting “two men of the same sex kissing”. The exact content is unavailable. The same individual was fined at least three times by the same judge on the same day for posting images."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_051 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2024"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-2180/2024" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e4b3d13d" .

p621:record_e536ef9d a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_f71d33ef ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1197746708917 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_412bf1d3 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The streaming service “PREMIER” was fined for the films “Perfect Strangers” (Paolo Genovese, 2016) and “Blow Dry” (2001, Paddy Breathnach). According to the court, these films “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors, because they were labelled “16+”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified eight scenes in the first film (00:58:46–00:59:09, 01:01:05–01:01:35, 01:01:36–01:03:50, 01:04:32–01:04:55, 01:05:56–01:06:35, 01:17:24–01:17:29, 01:17:40–01:20:40, 01:22:10–01:22:21) “demonstrating (or describing) homosexual relations between men, as well as references to homosexual relationships.” In the film “Blow Dry”, Roskomnadzor found the scene (01:21:45-01:22:01) with “two characters of the same sex (female) kissing in a sexual context.”"@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:17203,
        p621:381341 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-1040/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e536ef9d" .

p621:record_e559a9c1 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_7c3cebc1 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0031 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_a5334231 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is “The Great Snake’s Bride” (Fushiashikumo, 2021), which, according to the court, “promote non-traditional sexual relationships online” and “contained romantic and erotic illustrations involving a female character and a serpent-like creature”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en,
        "Менеджер проектов “Мангалиб”, платформы онлайн-комиксов и манги, был привлечён к ответственности за несколько публикаций. Публикация в этом деле – “Девушка замужем за Змеем” (Fushiashikumo, 2021). Согласно суду эта публикация содержит “неэпизодическое изображение нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений, представленное несколькими иллюстрациями лица женского пола (главной героиней) со звероподобным существом (воспринимается в качестве змеи) в романтическом и эротическом контексте: поцелуи, объятия, чувственные прикосновения, сексуально откровенные действия.” Это должностное лицо было оштрафовано за различные публикации не менее 12 раз. ООО “Мангалиб” также была оштрафована не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_010 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_27517825,
        p621:mentioned_in_7b4e742c ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0794/374/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e559a9c1" .

