p621:record_e6ee3bdb a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_80c7f1f7 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_8 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0022 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_detention_a9e9503f ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A Ukrainian citizen was found guilty of “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences or sex change” via the internet. The court did not specify the exact content that constituted the violation. As the judge reasoned, because the defendant was registered in one of the occupied Ukrainian regions, “he cannot be subject to deportation outside the Russian Federation”, so the defendant was arrested."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:web_content_001 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-497/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:23 ;
    schema:identifier "record_e6ee3bdb" .

p621:record_eb0139f4 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_76070739,
        p621:source_b22e3a24 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0019 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_23db56c6 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "Rapper Vacío was fined for “dissemination of information aimed at the formation of non-traditional sexual attitudes and the attractiveness of non-traditional sexual relationships” using Telegram. The court mentioned that the information the rapper shared was related to his participation in the celebrities' “Almost naked” themed party organised by the TV host and blogger Nastya Ivleeva. According to the court, this party was “aimed at promoting non-traditional sexual relations”, but it is not specified what information exactly constituted the violation."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_035 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_4bda8219 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-2472/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_eb0139f4" .

p621:record_eb32252e a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_0d918d42 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0104 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_3ddc37d4 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for posting “a voiceover accompanied by video footage showing two women kissing” on Instagram. The post is dated 14.02.2025. The judicial expert concluded that the content “presented same-sex female love in an attractive way (this is the type of relationship preferred by bloggers, fashionable and stylish-looking attractive modern women);” and that it presented “non-traditional sexual relations (not between a man and a woman) [...] in an attractive manner.” The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown. The same individual was fined at least six times on the same day by the same judge for posting similar content on Telegram and Instagram."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_091 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_e841c2de ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-0440/222/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_eb32252e" .

p621:record_eba38c47 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_f02e5108 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0014 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_90fa838f ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The executive of the streaming service “Megafon TV” was fined for the film “Love Is Love Is Love” (Eleanor Coppola, 2021), because it “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations on the timestamp 01:14:50-01:15:10”, namely the “messages about a same-sex wedding and the display of images of two women, accompanied by the words 'my picture, with my wife and our son'.” The company, which owns the streaming service, was also fined for the same title (see case 05-0915/2023)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:680590 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-633/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_eba38c47" .

p621:record_ebed1283 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_0972bde6 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0015 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_674150f2 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the streaming service “Tricolor Kino i TV Online” was fined for the film “The Key Game” (Vicente Villanueva, 2022). Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified ten scenes constituting the violation: “two girls, feigning passion, hint at the permissibility of sexual interaction between members of the same biological sex” (00:22:59-00:25:45); “a dialogue indicating the non-traditional sexual preferences of one of the characters” (00:44:35-00:45:40); “a dialogue touching on non-traditional sexual preferences and the feelings of one man for another” (00:56:25-00:58:16); “a scene showing the male characters walking in a park [...] confessing their feelings to each other” (01:01:37-01:02:25); “a scene that reveals a connection and love between two men” (01:04:08-01:04:49); “kissing male characters (01:28:20-01:28:46); “sexual interaction between two men” (01:28:49-01:29:09); “a scene of sexual intercourse between two men” (01:31:05-01:31:18); “scenes of simulated sexual intercourse” (01:28:11-01:29:38, 01:31:17-01:33:36); “a scene of a marriage between representatives of the same biological sex, two women and two men” (01:38:10-01:41:47)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:901908 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-840/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:78 ;
    schema:identifier "record_ebed1283" .

p621:record_ec5b8e32 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_65f3a9b8,
        p621:source_dece8f1c ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0024 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_cb998bd4 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The general director of the bookshop “Falanster” was fined for selling five titles: “More Happy Than Not” (Adam Silvera, 2015), “The Fruit of Knowledge” (Liv Strömquist, 2014), “The Miseducation of Cameron Post” (Emily Danforth, 2012), “Infernal Feminism” (Per Faxneld, 2022), “Fence, Vol. 2” (Pascat, 2018), “Everybody: A Book About Freedom” (Olivia Lang, 2021). The judicial expertise concluded that these books “contained psychological and linguistic signs of propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences and/or sex change, and also contain incentives to engage in LGBT relationships.” The legal entity of the bookshop was also fined for the same books by the same judge on the same day (see case 05-0268/2025)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:9785444817810,
        p621:OL20004466W,
        p621:OL22355901W,
        p621:OL24826887M,
        p621:OL35877617M,
        p621:comics_002 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_6a39b8b3 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0269/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_ec5b8e32" .

p621:record_ecee4623 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_400c6b45 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0009 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_21b1c535 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of “Clubbing TV” was fined for airing several music videos labelled “16+.” According to Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, these videos “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, including descriptions, depictions of non-traditional sexual relations and (or) preferences, or capable of causing a desire in minors to change sex, using mass media.” The court did not specify which videos or scenes violated the law."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:music_video_002 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1221/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_ecee4623" .

p621:record_ed66af93 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_26fd2212 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1047796736591 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_e517afdb ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The legal entity “FONBET TV”, which owns the music TV channel “TNT Music”, was fined for airing the music video “Hallucination” by Regard and Years & Years, labelled “16+”. According to the court, the music video “demonstrated non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences” among minors. The experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, identified two scenes, in which gestures made by “persons of the male biological sex [...] encourage the recipient to perceive their dance as an expression of sexual interaction between persons of the same biological sex.” The editor-in-chief of this TV channel was also fined for the same content (see case 5-1072/23)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:0rfBL_fCsI4 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-6769/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_ed66af93" .

p621:record_efc30f6c a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_b1dee009 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0059 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_d8cd7b45 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, sex change or refusal of child bearing” by posting an image on the Telegram channel “Free People glavny” in 2023. The police discovered the image during a social media monitoring operation. The judicial expertise concluded that the image depicted “scenes of sexual interaction between two persons of the same sex (women), one of whom is shown kneeling in front of the other”, and that these images were “not used to criticise LGBT people”. The same individual was fined at least four times on the same day by the same judge for posting images on this Telegram channel."@en,
        "Физическое лицо было оштрафовано за “пропаганду нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений и (или) предпочтений, смены пола либо отказа от деторождения” путём публикации изображения в 2023 году в Телеграм-канале “Free People главный”. Полиция обнаружила изображение в ходе операции по мониторингу социальных сетей. Судебная экспертиза указала, что изображение содержало “сцены сексуального взаимодействия между двумя лицами одного пола (девушки), одна из которых изображена стоящей на коленях перед другой”, а также что это изображение “не используется для критики ЛГБТ“. Это же физическое лицо было оштрафовано как минимум четыре раза в один и тот же день тем же судьёй за размещение изображений в этом Телеграм-канале."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_077 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-407/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_efc30f6c" .

p621:record_f03700e1 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_cee71276 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0067 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_8cbde539 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations” by publishing videos on social media. The videos depicted the cross-dresser in the costume of a “Winx” fairy on the territory of the Sretensky Monastery. According to the court, on the videos, “[the defendant] demonstrated transvestism by wearing clothes of the opposite sex”. The defendant explained to the court that it was his [pronouns as they appear in the court decision] everyday activity to cross-dress into the characters of “Monster High”, “Bratz”, and “Winx”, and other popular characters; he “had to hide his hobbies from his family, changed his clothes and washed off his makeup in advance, so that his family and neighbors [...] would not find out about it.”"@en,
        "Физическое лицо оштрафовано за “пропаганду нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений” путём публикации видео в социальных сетях. По описанию из постановления видео изображало, как кросс-дрессер в костюме феи Winx на территории Сретенского монастыря подходит к священнослужителю. По мнению суда на видео “[ответчик] демонстрировал трансвестизм путем ношения одежды противоположного пола”. Ответчик объяснил суду, что он [местоимения из постановления] наносит макияж персонажей из “Monster High”, “Bratz”, “Winx” и других; он “скрывал свои увлечения от семьи, заранее переодевался и смывал косметику, чтобы его семья и соседи [...] не узнали об этом”."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_093 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_a486a0cb,
        p621:mentioned_in_c345bae3 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0183/451/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_f03700e1" .

p621:record_f0703f0b a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_fa997547 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_1 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1027739678592 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_9f9d9b3e ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "“New Literary Review” was fined for publishing the book by P Faxneld “Infernal Feminism” (Series “Gender Studies”) and distributing it through the bookstore “Falanster”. The judicial expert in the case concluded that the book “contains psychological and linguistic characteristics of propaganda promoting non-traditional sexual relations and a preference for sex change, as well as psychologically influencing the reader and encouraging them to engage in LGBT relationships.” According to the case, there were 55 copies available in the store that were subsequently confiscated and destroyed."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:9785444817810 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_4dce87fc ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-270/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_f0703f0b" .

p621:record_f0bf5009 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_fe67ddd4 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0042 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_5ac80d9c ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for publishing six videos between 2012 and 2015: the music video “Cliffs Edge” by Hayley Kiyoko (2015) and other videos titled “boys kissing”, “Takumi-kun 2. Rainbow glow”, “U”, “Miles & Kyler”, “boys are being naughty”. The court pointed out that each of these videos depicted kisses either between two men or two women; these videos were “related to the promotion of non-traditional sexual relations of the LGBT community” and were of “an extremist nature”."@en ;
