p621:record_f0e71207 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_42488b6f ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0052 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_755dbd6c ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for a 15-second TikTok video. According to the inspection record, the video showed the defendant “wearing headphones, with long hair and a black T-shirt, moving to music while text appeared on screen”. The exact text is unknown. During the hearing, police argued that “the text placed on the video together with the song indicates the formation of a positive attitude toward non-traditional sexual relations.” The same individual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos."@en ;
