p621:record_f8a6568f a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_135a7e2c ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0052 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_3e55bcba ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for a 15-second video. The court described the video showing “a young man with long hair, headphones, glasses and a black T-shirt moving to music, with the caption: I sing for all the male consultants of Golden Apple [a chain of beauty shops].” The court held that the caption, together with the music, was sufficient to disseminate “propaganda of non-traditional sexual relations”. The same individual was prosecuted at least 7 times for different TikTok videos."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_116 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_bc832cac ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-310/87/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_f8a6568f" .

p621:record_f8b290c1 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_d98a66b8 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1117746765311 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_8243458a ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The film distribution company “Russian Report” was fined for airing the TV series “Episodes” (David Crane and Jeffrey Klarik, 2011) on the “KinoLiving” TV channel with the label “16+”. The court stated that the series contained “the demonstration of non-traditional sexual relations expressed by a visual component: the depiction of sensual interaction between two persons of the same biological sex (female), namely: a prolonged kiss expressing sexual passion; caressing movements of the hand of one woman on the chest area of the other.” It is said that this judicial expertise was based on the “classification of kisses”, which was also mentioned in the case 5-1073/23. Earlier, the editor-in-chief of the TV channel was also fined for distributing the TV series (case 5-1000/23)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:31841 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-6399/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_f8b290c1" .

p621:record_f8cae0be a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_6ea895e1 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_4 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0031 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_907a7ea5 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The project manager at “Mangalib”, a platform for online comics and manga, was prosecuted for several publications. The publication in this case is the manga titled “With You, Our Love Will Make It Through” (Yuzuki Chihiro, 2021) about an imaginary interracial relationship. The court stated that it contained “non-episodic depiction of a non-traditional sexual relationship between the main character, represented by several illustrations of a female person with a beast-like creature (perceived as an animal) in a romantic context: kissing, hugging, sensual touching”. This individual was fined at least 12 times for different publications. The company “MangaLib” was also fined at least 12 times."@en,
        "Менеджер проектов “Мангалиб”, платформы онлайн-комиксов и манги, был привлечён к ответственности за несколько публикаций. Публикация в этом деле – “Пересечение стен любви с тобой / Kimi to Koete Koi ni Naru” (Yuzuki Chihiro, 2021). Суд установил, что эта публикация содержит “неэпизодическое изображение нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений между главной героиней, представленное несколькими иллюстрациями лица женского пола со звероподобным существом (воспринимается в качестве животного) в романтическом контексте: поцелуи, объятия, чувственные прикосновения.” Это должностное лицо было оштрафовано за различные публикации не менее 12 раз. ООО “Мангалиб” также была оштрафована не менее 12 раз."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:comics_011 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_27517825,
        p621:mentioned_in_7b4e742c ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0749/374/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_f8cae0be" .

p621:record_fa24c81e a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_627bedf3 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0010 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_eb11d71d ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the music TV channel “O2TV” was fined for airing the music video “Крылья” (“Wings”) by “Dezery”. Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, determined that the music video “vividly demonstrates the main character's conscious rejection of traditional sexual relations; she is willing to confront her mother and the entire world. The communicative purpose of [the video] is to create a distorted perception of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences.” The company, which owns the TV channel, was also fined for the same music video (see case 05-7506/2023)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:mLJM9jLwo2c ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-1188/23" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_fa24c81e" .

p621:record_fb2a5a82 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_d965606f ;
