p621:record_fb7af25e a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_c81f04f7 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_2_part_2 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:1077757496937 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_bf2784ab ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The TV channel “Zhara TV” was fined for broadcasting the music video “Girls” (2018) by Rita Ora featuring Cardi B, Bebe Rexha, and Charli XCX to minors under a 16+ age rating. The judgment treated the clip as a multimodal audiovisual text and closely described its visual composition, noting first a sequence in which women dressed in light-coloured garments sing together, communicate, and exchange gestures of affection, while “the atmosphere of what is happening is hedonistic” and the overall imagery is “perceived as an ancient Greek Sapphic salon.” A second sequence was analysed separately: one female figure observes another through holographic imagery, the two move closer, and their interaction is presented at “an intimate interpersonal distance” involving “touching, as well as a kiss on the lips.” These quoted visual observations formed the core of the court’s reasoning that the clip demonstrated “non-traditional sexual relations” and therefore could not lawfully remain accessible to minors under a 16+ classification. Earlier, the editor-in-chief of this TV channel was fined for the same music video (see case 5-955/23)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:ExJmET8boVw ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2023"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-6398/2023" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_fb7af25e" .

p621:record_fc6fc50a a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_d0626e31 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0059 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_6eda23d4 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "An individual was fined for “promoting non-traditional sexual relations and/or preferences, sex change or refusal of child bearing” by posting three images on the Telegram channel “Free People glavny” in 2023. The police discovered the images during a social media monitoring operation. The judicial expertise concluded that the images depicted “scenes of sexual interaction between three female persons”, “the characters' posture and position relative to each other express their amorous and erotic attraction to each other”, and that these images were “not used to criticise LGBT people”. The same individual was fined at least four times on the same day by the same judge for posting images on this Telegram channel."@en,
        "Физическое лицо было оштрафовано за “пропаганду нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений и (или) предпочтений, смены пола либо отказа от деторождения” путём публикации трёх изображений в 2023 году в Телеграм-канале “Free People главный”. Полиция обнаружила изображения в ходе операции по мониторингу социальных сетей. Судебная экспертиза указала, что изображения содержали “сцены сексуального взаимодействия между [...] лицами женского пола”, что “поза и расположение персонажей относительно друг друга выражают их любовно-эротическое влечение друг к другу”, а также что эти изображения “не используются для критики ЛГБТ“. Это же физическое лицо было оштрафовано как минимум четыре раза в один и тот же день тем же судьёй за размещение изображений в этом Телеграм-канале."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_048f28c4,
        p621:social_media_080,
        p621:social_media_a7da146f ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-404/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_fc6fc50a" .

p621:record_fd922a00 a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_881ab7ae ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:official_0036 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_e917ae33 ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The editor-in-chief of the online media “Sports24” was fined for publishing the article titled “The three-time Olympic champion suddenly came out. She kept it a secret for over 12 years.” The judicial experts from Roskomnadzor, the Russian mass media regulator, determined that this article “was structured in such a way that it created a socio-psychological attitude not only of approval of non-traditional sexual relations, but also formed a distorted idea of the social equivalence of traditional and non-traditional sexual relations”. Picture: a screenshot of the article's title."@en,
        "Главный редактор сетевого издания “Спорт24” был оштрафован за публикацию статьи под названием “Трехкратная олимпийская чемпионка внезапно совершила каминг-аут. Она держала это в тайне больше 12 лет”. Судебные эксперты установили, в статье “создается социально-психологическая установка не только одобрения нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений, но и формируется искаженное представление о социальной равноценности традиционных и нетрадиционных сексуальных отношений”. Фото: скриншот заголовка статьи."@ru ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:mass_media_008 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_10d28d88 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "5-672/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_fd922a00" .

p621:record_fe45d3fa a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_ac28c120 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0076 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_7cb9c7dc ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "A VKontakte user was fined for “an image and English-language text commenting on it” published in 2015, which “promoted non-traditional sexual relations among minors”. The court referred to this image as “a comic in the genre of 'sexual comedy, LGBT'.” The exact image is unknown. The same individual was fined twice on the same day by the same judge for publishing images on VK (see also 05-0212/2025)."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_084 ;
    dataout:monitoredIncidentYear "2025"^^xsd:gYear ;
    dataout:monitoringRecordNumber "05-0211/2025" ;
    schema:addressRegion region:77 ;
    schema:identifier "record_fe45d3fa" .

p621:record_fe79ba7e a dataout:MonitoringRecord ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom p621:source_a2796b7f ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy p621:MonitoringDec2025 ;
    dataout:concernsLegalArticle law:article_6_21_part_3 ;
    dataout:hasDefendant p621:individual_0024 ;
    dataout:hasPenalty p621:pen_fine_803d0f0f ;
    dataout:hasSnippet "The blogger Milana Petrova was fined for “a thematic information post containing propaganda for non-traditional same-sex sexual relations” on her Telegram channel “PETROVA”. The exact content that constituted the violation is unknown. The amount of the fine has been redacted from the court ruling."@en ;
    dataout:hasTriggerObject p621:social_media_045 ;
    dataout:mentionedIn p621:mentioned_in_c53d57fe ;
